⚡🇺🇸 Trump intends to keep the suspense surrounding his successor going for as long as possible, the New York Post reports, citing a source.

As noted, he "savors fomenting competition among his team." He will likely refrain from officially endorsing any of the Republican contenders for the 2028 U.S. presidential race until the very last moment.

@MedmanNews

⚡🇨🇳 Chinese scientists have developed a suit enabling a robotic dog to operate in temperatures of up to 1,000 degrees Celsius. 

According to the South China Morning Post, the technology could be used by firefighters and military personnel.

